Attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Handy application was co-developed by Yota Taue and Allen Lee
(@P0PCAT-012345). This covers the React frontend under src/, the websocket
server under server/, the original embedding model weights at
server/model/weights.h5, and the training notebooks under train/.

The research contribution under experiments/ and research/ is the work of Yota Taue,
carried out at the Nakazawa-Ohkoshi Laboratory, Faculty of Policy Management,
Keio University. This covers the class-disjoint evaluation harness, the hand
detection fallback, DBA prototype aggregation, the batched Soft-DTW
implementation, the continuous-stream benchmark, and conformal threshold
calibration.

